==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (4,000%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[UltraBaaBaa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[General GreGory]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (4,000%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (4,000%) spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Johnnyleon]] spawns.
**2 [[Youcan]]s spawn, delay 29.33~33.33 seconds<sup>880f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Alpacky]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is a breeze compared to [[Glass Slippers|certain]] [[Happily Ever After|stages]] in the previous subchapter. Simply stack units with forward pierce to your hearts content, as well as [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] on the UltraBaaBaa until you are satisfied, then use [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] to get rid of her. From there, you can clear the stage with ease, although do bring a Barrier Breaker other than [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]] if you are using [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]], as its high speed tends to cause Johnnyleon to stay at the base with the Youcans, meaning Golfer cannot actually break their barriers.

